              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, bow, and horse. May take shield (+2 pts). Nomad Cavalry. Skirmishers. Throughout the medieval era, Hungarian armies had in common a large proportion of western style familiares coupled with Cuman and Kipchak Turk horse archers. (Vlad the Impaler p.14)</characteristic>
