            <profile id="fe0d-c3fe-2d26-3752" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="dab5-785d-be28-f228" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, halberd or flail (counts as halberd), and heavy armour. May wear partial plate (+2 pts), and carry a shield (+1 pt). Veteran. May be taken in Mixed Order with Crossbowmen or Handgunners. Not available to Arpad &amp; Angevin armies. (Vlad the Impaler p.14)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
