              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, thrusting spear, light armour, and shield. May upgrade to large shield (+1 pt). Clipeati and Hussites may be in Mixed Order with Archers, Crossbowmen, or Handgunners. Clipeati pavisiers - Bohemian Hussite mercenaries. Not available to Arpad &amp; Angevin armies. (Vlad the Impaler p.14)</characteristic>
