              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon and bow. May take shield or buckler (+1 pt). Open Order. May be in Mixed Order with Spearmen or Clipeati, and then become Close Order. Archers entered Hungarian service from the ranks of the free peasant jobbágy, but also from the principalities of Bosnia, Croatia, and Transylvania. (Vlad the Impaler p.15)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
