              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Three crewmen (8 pts each). May have light armour (+2 pts per model). Mantlets may be purchased at 10 pts per Bombard. Artillery. Heavy Artillery. Mantlets. The Light Bombard is not available to Arpad &amp; Angevin armies (only a Heavy Bombard, after 1380). (Vlad the Impaler p.15)</characteristic>
