              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Three crewmen (8 pts each). May have light armour (+2 pts per model). Mantlets may be purchased at 10 pts per Bombard. Artillery. Heavy Artillery. Mantlets. Despite being among the first nations in south-eastern Europe to make use of artillery, Hungary seemed to use only heavy bombards for far longer after other nations made use of more mobile artillery. (Vlad the Impaler p.15)</characteristic>
