              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, lance, heavy armour, shield, horse. Impetuous. May count rank bonus of up to +1. May be taken in Mixed Order with Crusading Knights. One unit of Crusader Knights must be taken for every unit of Crusader Sergeants if Crusader cavalry is taken (not enforced). (Vlad the Impaler p.15)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
