            <profile id="98dc-b3b1-23c5-cbe9" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="dab5-785d-be28-f228" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Mounted - hand weapon, thrusting spear, heavy armour, shield, and warhorse. May take cloth (+4 pts) or plate (+6 pts) barding. May take partial or full plate armour (free if mounted). German Wedge if mounted. Allies and Mercenaries. 0-1 Mounted unit. Largely German and Bohemian Knights, Armigeri were an important feature of the Black Army of Király Mátyás. (Vlad the Impaler p.15)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="eac8-f635-769f-2fdd" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
